swapped back to A: A[born=4 n=0]
swapped to C (other state layout): C[born=5]
swapped back to A again: A[born=6 n=0]
A n written 9: A[born=6 n=9]
swapped to A.padding(1) (A inside another type): A[born=7 n=0]
swapped back to plain A: A[born=8 n=0]
tuple, if false: Counter[born=9]
tuple, if true: Counter[born=9]
